row
  text $10
  text a month
  text Your name will be put on the Bulma website’s backers page, and in backers.md in the Bulma repository.
row
  text $30
  text a month
  text Your name will be put at the top of the Bulma website’s backers page, and at the top of backers.md in the Bulma repository.
row
