  text a month
  text Your name or company logo will appear on the Bulma documentation sidebar.
row
  text What is the difference between Patreon and Github?
  col
    text There is no difference in terms of rewards.
    text The main difference is that Patreon charges VAT based on your location.
    text If you already have a GitHub account, your sponsorship will be billed at the same time as your GitHub subscription.
    text In any case, choose the easiest option for you.
